    The AUTHORITATIVE firmware build. Produces both pico_debug.uf2 and
    sketch.uf2.

    The CMake profile beside it builds the same thing with the same settings and
    is what CLion uses for indexing and for the green hammer. This script is what
    to run when something is being flashed for real - it checks the toolchain,
    the SDK and picotool first and says which one is missing rather than failing
    a thousand lines into a build.
